This product includes software and design elements adapted from gpui, the UI
framework used by Zed (https://github.com/zed-industries/zed), which is
licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

The adaptation is limited to the glyph atlas and instanced sprite rendering
strategy. See crates/kasumi-backend/src/atlas.rs and
crates/kasumi-backend/src/renderer.rs. The gpui source tree that was used as
reference material during development is not part of this project and is
excluded from version control.

Text shaping, font fallback, line breaking and rasterization are implemented
in crates/kasumi-text using these third-party libraries:

- fontdb (https://github.com/RazrFalcon/fontdb), MIT
- swash (https://github.com/dfrg/swash), Apache-2.0 OR MIT
- unicode-bidi (https://github.com/servo/unicode-bidi), MIT OR Apache-2.0
- unicode-linebreak (https://github.com/axelf4/unicode-linebreak), Apache-2.0

The Chromium-style smooth scrolling model in
crates/kasumi-tree/src/scroll_physics.rs is adapted from the scrollable widget
in iced (https://github.com/iced-rs/iced), licensed under the MIT License. The
animation curve, duration ramp and velocity-preserving retargeting derive from
Chromium's `cc/animation/scroll_offset_animation_curve`, which is licensed
under the BSD 3-Clause License (https://chromium.googlesource.com/chromium/src/).
